    "title": "4/20 food deals: Where to get discounts and freebies on April 20",
    "text": "(SavorNation) – It can be argued that the mystique surrounding 4/20 is dissipating like a puff of smoke, perhaps due to the decriminalization of marijuana in many U.S. districts over the last several years, or the ongoing corporatization of its culture and ideals. But hey, high people still need to eat, right? Knowing this, plenty of popular national restaurant chains are offering deals or freebies in honor of 4/20, like special pizza bundles, discounted ice cream, or even complimentary frisbees. Check out a baker’s dozen of the aforementioned 4/20 deals below. BJ’s Restaurant & Brewhouse Guests who visit BJ’s Restaurant & Brewhouse after 9 p.m. on 4/20 can order the restaurant chain’s signature Pizookie (a large cookie served in a pizza pan with ice cream) for just $4.20. Blaze Pizza Blaze Pizza is offering a limited-time deal on its “BFF Bundle” at participating locations on 4/20: Customers ordering online or via the Blaze Rewards app can order two 11-inch pizzas, two drinks and two desserts for $25.99. (Prices may vary, depending on location.) Cheba Hut Cheba Hut customers who order in-store on 4/20 can get a Nug (4-inch toasted sandwich) for just $4. The sandwich shops are also giving customers special-edition frisbees while supplies last. Chipotle While not necessarily tied to 4/20, Chipotle is offering a buy-one-get-one deal for customers in honor of the upcoming Stanley Cup playoffs: On April 20, guests who wear a hockey jersey into a participating shop can get a BOGO entrée while ordering in-store after 3 p.m. local time. Dunkin’ In honor of “National Cold Brew Day,” which just so happens to fall on 4/20, Dunkin’ is offering its Dunkin’ Rewards members four times the points on purchases of cold brew items. Fatburger Burger-lovers ordering online at Fatburger.com can redeem an original Fatburger for just $4.20 at participating restaurants nationwide. GoPuff GoPuff users can redeem $1 pints of Ben & Jerry’s ice cream for three hours between 3 p.m. and 6 p.m. ET on April 20. Members who belong to the GoPuff FAM (a subscription tier) can also buy select varieties of Ben & Jerry’s for $4.20 per pint, all day. Insomnia Cookies Insomnia Rewards members can buy four cookies at participating Insomnia locations and get two additional cookies for free on April 20. Deal is valid for both in-store and pickup orders. Jimmy John’s Participating locations of Jimmy John’s are offering a buy-one-get-one deal on the chain’s limited-time “Dream Rotation” meals, which include a toasted sandwich, a bag of Jimmy Chips, and a Cereal ‘N Milk Crispy Treat. Customers will need to use the offer code DREAMROTATION at checkout. Mellow Mushroom Mellow Mushroom pizzerias are celebrating 4/20 with $4.20 orders of pretzel bites or Mellow Rollz (a pizza roll-type item) at participating locations. KFC Customers who order via their KFC Rewards account (online or in the KFC app) can redeem one of three special 4/20 deals at participating restaurants: a Chicken Pot Pie meal (pot pie and a drink) for $4.20; a Chick ‘N Nug meal (six pieces of chicken, 12 nuggets, two large sides, four biscuits and two sauces) for $20; or two-piece deal (two tenders or two pieces of dark-meat chicken) for $2.95. Sonic Participating Sonic Drive-Ins are offering original corn dogs for just 99 cents on April 20. Taco Bell (via DoorDash or UberEats) Taco Bell fans can get a free large order of Nacho Fries when placing an order of $20 or more through DoorDash or UberEats on April 20.",
